<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - CORIMON.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - CORIMON.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Friday Corimon SACA, Westmoreland Coal Co, Westmoreland preferred A stock and Mid-American Waste Systems Inc were unavailable for after-hours trading.</p>
</text>
